{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50730","headline":"题李山人园林 · 张祜","name":"题李山人园林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年垂钓碧江浔，长爱严陵是此心。\n万壑深秋闻伐木，一溪长日看淘金。\n桑生壠上螟蛉挂，竹在沙头翡翠沉。\n唯道石田堪种黍，不将衰髪羡华簪。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}